error[TY011]: a List<Str> is indexed by a Num, not an Option
  --> index-type.lm:12:10
   |
12 | print(xs[xs.indexOf("delta")])
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ expected Num
   |
   = note: an Option holds the number rather than being one
   = note: take it out first: `match … { Some(i) => xs[i], None => … }`

error[TY011]: a Map is indexed by a Str, not a Num
  --> index-type.lm:17:14
   |
17 | print(counts[1])
   |              ^ expected Str
   |
   = note: every Map key is a Str; `${…}` turns a value into one

error[TY011]: a Str is indexed by a Num, not a Str
  --> index-type.lm:21:12
   |
21 | print(word["a"])
   |            ^^^ expected Num
   |

error[TY011]: a Num cannot be indexed
  --> index-type.lm:25:7
   |
25 | print(n[0])
   |       ^^^^ not indexable
   |
   = note: `[…]` reads from a List, a Str or a Map

